{"seq":4,"slug":"event-storming","title":"事件风暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/domain-driven-design/architecture-integration/event-storming","wordCount":725,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"事件风暴\">事件风暴</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>事件风暴（Event Storming）是由 Alberto Brandolini 发明的一种协作式建模工作坊。它通过在大面积墙上粘贴彩色便利贴，让领域专家和开发者共同发现业务事件、命令、聚合和策略，从而快速建立对复杂业务领域的共同理解。</p>\n<p>事件风暴不是写代码，而是在写代码之前确保所有人对业务有一致的理解。它是连接&quot;业务需求&quot;和&quot;DDD 模型设计&quot;的桥梁，其产出直接映射为限界上下文、聚合和领域事件。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[橙色&lt;br/&gt;领域事件] --&gt; B[蓝色&lt;br/&gt;命令]&#10;    B --&gt; C[黄色&lt;br/&gt;聚合]&#10;    C --&gt; A&#10;    D[紫色&lt;br/&gt;策略/规则] --&gt; B&#10;    E[粉色&lt;br/&gt;外部系统] -.-&gt; A&#10;    F[红色&lt;br/&gt;热点/问题] -.-&gt; A&#10;    G[绿色&lt;br/&gt;读模型/视图] -.-&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[橙色&lt;br/&gt;领域事件] --&gt; B[蓝色&lt;br/&gt;命令]\n    B --&gt; C[黄色&lt;br/&gt;聚合]\n    C --&gt; A\n    D[紫色&lt;br/&gt;策略/规则] --&gt; B\n    E[粉色&lt;br/&gt;外部系统] -.-&gt; A\n    F[红色&lt;br/&gt;热点/问题] -.-&gt; A\n    G[绿色&lt;br/&gt;读模型/视图] -.-&gt; A</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>便利贴颜色</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>🟧 橙色</td>\n<td>领域事件（已发生的事实）</td>\n<td>订单已创建、支付已完成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🟦 蓝色</td>\n<td>命令（触发事件的动作）</td>\n<td>创建订单、确认支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🟨 黄色</td>\n<td>聚合（处理命令的实体）</td>\n<td>订单、支付、库存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🟪 紫色</td>\n<td>策略/业务规则</td>\n<td>VIP 满减规则、库存预警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🟩 绿色</td>\n<td>读模型/视图</td>\n<td>订单列表、仪表盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🟥 红色</td>\n<td>热点/问题/疑问</td>\n<td>并发冲突、边界不清</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🩷 粉色</td>\n<td>外部系统</td>\n<td>支付网关、物流API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>🧑 小人贴</td>\n<td>角色/用户</td>\n<td>买家、卖家、管理员</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"工作坊流程\">工作坊流程</h2><p>事件风暴工作坊通常分为四个阶段，每个阶段逐步深入。</p>\n<p><strong>第一阶段：事件头脑风暴</strong></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 所有参与者自由写出他们知道的领域事件&#10;// 不讨论、不排序、不过滤&#10;const brainstormEvents = [&#10;  &#39;用户注册成功&#39;,&#10;  &#39;商品上架&#39;,&#10;  &#39;订单已创建&#39;,&#10;  &#39;支付已发起&#39;,&#10;  &#39;支付已完成&#39;,&#10;  &#39;支付失败&#39;,&#10;  &#39;库存已扣减&#39;,&#10;  &#39;订单已发货&#39;,&#10;  &#39;订单已签收&#39;,&#10;  &#39;退款已申请&#39;,&#10;  &#39;退款已处理&#39;,&#10;  &#39;优惠券已使用&#39;,&#10;  &#39;库存不足告警&#39;,&#10;  &#39;用户地址已更新&#39;,&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 所有参与者自由写出他们知道的领域事件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不讨论、不排序、不过滤</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> brainstormEvents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '用户注册成功'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '商品上架'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '订单已创建'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '支付已发起'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '支付已完成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '支付失败'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '库存已扣减'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '订单已发货'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '订单已签收'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '退款已申请'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '退款已处理'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '优惠券已使用'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '库存不足告警'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  '用户地址已更新'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第二阶段：时间线排序</strong></p>\n<p>将事件按业务流程的时间线排列，发现事件之间的因果关系和遗漏。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[商品上架] --&gt; B[用户浏览商品]&#10;    B --&gt; C[加入购物车]&#10;    C --&gt; D[创建订单]&#10;    D --&gt; E[支付发起]&#10;    E --&gt; F{支付结果}&#10;    F --&gt;|成功| G[支付完成]&#10;    F --&gt;|失败| H[支付失败]&#10;    G --&gt; I[库存扣减]&#10;    I --&gt; J[订单发货]&#10;    J --&gt; K[订单签收]&#10;    K --&gt; L[评价完成]\">graph LR\n    A[商品上架] --&gt; B[用户浏览商品]\n    B --&gt; C[加入购物车]\n    C --&gt; D[创建订单]\n    D --&gt; E[支付发起]\n    E --&gt; F{支付结果}\n    F --&gt;|成功| G[支付完成]\n    F --&gt;|失败| H[支付失败]\n    G --&gt; I[库存扣减]\n    I --&gt; J[订单发货]\n    J --&gt; K[订单签收]\n    K --&gt; L[评价完成]</pre><p><strong>第三阶段：添加命令和聚合</strong></p>\n<p>为每个事件找到触发它的命令，以及处理命令的聚合。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 命令 → 聚合 → 事件 的三元组&#10;const commandAggregateEvents = [&#10;  {&#10;    command: &#39;创建订单&#39;,&#10;    actor: &#39;买家&#39;,&#10;    aggregate: &#39;订单&#39;,&#10;    events: [&#39;订单已创建&#39;],&#10;    policies: [&#39;库存预检查&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    command: &#39;确认支付&#39;,&#10;    actor: &#39;支付网关(回调)&#39;,&#10;    aggregate: &#39;支付&#39;,&#10;    events: [&#39;支付已完成&#39;],&#10;    policies: [&#39;金额一致性校验&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    command: &#39;扣减库存&#39;,&#10;    actor: &#39;系统(支付完成触发)&#39;,&#10;    aggregate: &#39;库存&#39;,&#10;    events: [&#39;库存已扣减&#39;, &#39;库存不足告警&#39;],&#10;    policies: [&#39;安全库存阈值&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    command: &#39;发货&#39;,&#10;    actor: &#39;卖家&#39;,&#10;    aggregate: &#39;物流&#39;,&#10;    events: [&#39;订单已发货&#39;],&#10;    policies: [&#39;物流公司分配规则&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 命令 → 聚合 → 事件 的三元组</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> commandAggregateEvents</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    command: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'创建订单'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'买家'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    aggregate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单已创建'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    policies: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'库存预检查'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    command: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'确认支付'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付网关(回调)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    aggregate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'支付已完成'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    policies: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'金额一致性校验'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    command: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'扣减库存'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'系统(支付完成触发)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    aggregate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'库存'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'库存已扣减'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'库存不足告警'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    policies: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'安全库存阈值'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    command: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'发货'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    actor: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'卖家'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    aggregate: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'物流'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    events: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'订单已发货'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    policies: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'物流公司分配规则'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>第四阶段：识别限界上下文</strong></p>\n<p>通过观察聚合之间的关系和语言边界，划分出限界上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从事件风暴到代码\">从事件风暴到代码</h2><p>事件风暴的产出可以直接映射为 DDD 的战术模式代码。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 事件风暴产出 → 代码映射&#10;&#10;// 🟨 黄色便利贴 &quot;订单&quot; → 聚合根&#10;class Order extends AggregateRoot {&#10;  private status: OrderStatus;&#10;  private items: OrderLineItem[];&#10;  private payment: PaymentReference | null;&#10;&#10;  // 🟦 蓝色便利贴 &quot;创建订单&quot; → 聚合方法&#10;  static create(id: OrderId, customerId: CustomerId, items: OrderLineItem[]): Order {&#10;    const order = new Order(id, customerId, items);&#10;    // 🟧 橙色便利贴 &quot;订单已创建&quot; → 领域事件&#10;    order.addDomainEvent(new OrderCreated(id.value, customerId.value, new Date()));&#10;    return order;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 🟦 &quot;确认支付&quot; → 聚合方法&#10;  confirmPayment(paymentId: PaymentId, amount: Money): void {&#10;    if (!this.totalAmount.equals(amount)) {&#10;      throw new DomainError(&#39;Payment amount mismatch&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    this.payment = PaymentReference.create(paymentId);&#10;    this.status = &#39;paid&#39;;&#10;    // 🟧 &quot;支付已确认&quot; → 领域事件&#10;    this.addDomainEvent(new OrderPaymentConfirmed(this.id.value, paymentId.value, new Date()));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 🟦 &quot;申请退款&quot; → 聚合方法&#10;  requestRefund(reason: string): void {&#10;    if (this.status !== &#39;paid&#39; &amp;&amp; this.status !== &#39;shipped&#39;) {&#10;      throw new DomainError(&#39;Cannot refund in current status&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    this.status = &#39;refund_requested&#39;;&#10;    // 🟧 &quot;退款已申请&quot; → 领域事件&#10;    this.addDomainEvent(new RefundRequested(this.id.value, reason, new Date()));&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  constructor(&#10;    readonly id: OrderId,&#10;    private readonly customerId: CustomerId,&#10;    items: OrderLineItem[],&#10;  ) {&#10;    super();&#10;    this.items = items;&#10;    this.status = &#39;created&#39;;&#10;    this.payment = null;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  get totalAmount(): Money {&#10;    return this.items.reduce((sum, i) =&gt; sum.add(i.subtotal), Money.create(0, &#39;CNY&#39;));&#10;  }&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 🟪 紫色便利贴 &quot;库存预检查&quot; → 领域服务或策略&#10;class InventoryCheckPolicy {&#10;  constructor(private readonly inventoryPort: InventoryPort) {}&#10;&#10;  async verify(items: Array&lt;{ productId: string; quantity: number }&gt;): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;    for (const item of items) {&#10;      const available = await this.inventoryPort.checkStock(item.productId);&#10;      if (available &lt; item.quantity) return false;&#10;    }&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 事件风暴产出 → 代码映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 